    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0615_line_0069",
      "lineIndex": 69,
      "gurmukhi": "ਇਹ ਭਾਤਿ ਦੀਹ ਕਰਿ ਦੇਸ ਰਾਜ ॥",
      "transliteration": "eeh bhaat dheeh kar dhes raaj ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ (ਉਸ ਨੇ) ਬੜੀ ਤਕੜਾਈ ਨਾਲ ਦੇਸ ਉਤੇ ਰਾਜ ਕੀਤਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 615,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "इह भाति दीह करि देस राज ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100759",
      "sourceShabadId": "9289",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0615_line_0070",
      "lineIndex": 70,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਹੁ ਕਰੇ ਜਗਿ ਅਰੁ ਹੋਮ ਸਾਜ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bahu kare jag ar hom saaj ||",
      "translation": "In this way, after conquering many kings, manu performed many hom-yajnas,",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਬਹੁਤ ਸਾਰੇ ਹੋਮ ਸਾਜੇ ਅਤੇ ਯੱਗ ਕੀਤੇ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 615,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बहु करे जगि अरु होम साज ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100760",
      "sourceShabadId": "9289",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0615_line_0071",
      "lineIndex": 71,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਹੁ ਭਾਤਿ ਸ੍ਵਰਣ ਕਰਿ ਕੈ ਸੁ ਦਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bahu bhaat savairan kar kai su dhaan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਬਹੁਤ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਨਾਲ ਸੋਨਾ ਦਾਨ ਕੀਤਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 615,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बहु भाति स्वरण करि कै सु दान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "100761",
      "sourceShabadId": "9289",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0615_line_0072",
      "lineIndex": 72,
      "gurmukhi": "ਗੋਦਾਨ ਆਦਿ ਬਿਧਵਤ ਸਨਾਨ ॥੧੫॥",
      "transliteration": "godhaan aadh bidhavat sanaan ||15||",
      "translation": "He bestowed different typed of charities of gold and cows and took bath at various pilgrim-satations.15.",
